    "ffmpeg": {
      "notes": [
        "Required by the recording-ui-walkthroughs skill, which encodes walkthrough recordings with it. Nothing builds or ships with ffmpeg.",
        "A static single-file build per platform, so a recording is reproducible without brew/apt version drift and without an npm postinstall fetching an unverified binary.",
        "The assets are bare executables rather than archives: download, verify, chmod +x.",
        "linux-arm and linux-ia32 assets also exist upstream; add them if a runner ever needs one.",
        "The release tag is authoritative, not the binary's own -version string: builds under tag b6.1.1 report 6.0 on some platforms."
      ],
